     1,
     "<div>Hi INLA group,</div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"2\">I want  to estimate mortality rate or prevalence rate (crude rate) <span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">using the </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">R-INLA</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> package to produce smoothed county level </span>mortality rate or prevalence rate (crude rate)<span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">,  t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">he model includes two random effects(s</span><span style=\"color:rgb(27,27,27);font-family:Cambria,&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,Charter,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,stixgeneral,serif\">patially structured and unstructured random effect), and I assume the response variable Y(</span></font><span style=\"font-size:small\">mortality rate</span><span style=\"color:rgb(27,27,27);font-family:Cambria,&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,Charter,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,stixgeneral,serif;font-size:small\">) is lognormal distributed, how can I modify the code below:</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(27,27,27);font-family:Cambria,&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,Charter,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,stixgeneral,serif;font-size:small\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1.5em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;line-height:1.3;font-size:1.2rem;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">Neighborhood matrix</span><span style=\"color:rgb(27,27,27);font-family:Cambria,&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,Charter,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,stixgeneral,serif;font-size:small\"></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(27,27,27);font-family:Cambria,&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,Charter,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,Times,stixgeneral,serif;font-size:small\">#</span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">We create the neighborhood matrix needed to define the spatial random effect using the </span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">poly2nb()</span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> and the </span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">nb2INLA()</span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> functions </span></font></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">nb &lt;- poly2nb(MapData_368version)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">nb2INLA(&quot;map.adj&quot;, nb)</div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">g &lt;- inla.read.graph(filename = &quot;map.adj&quot;) </div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">#g which we will later use to specific the spatial random effect<br> </div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1.5em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;line-height:1.3;font-size:1.2rem;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">Inference using INLA</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1.5em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;line-height:1.3;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">#</font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">The model includes two random effects, </font></span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">for modeling the spatial residual variation, and modeling unstructured noise. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">We need to include two vectors in the data that denote the indices of these random effects. We call </span></font><span style=\"font-size:small\">re_u</span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> the indices vector </span></font><span style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">and </span><span style=\"font-size:small\">re_v </span><span style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">the indices vector.</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-size:small;font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> We set both </span><span style=\"font-size:small\">re_u </span><span style=\"white-space:pre;word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-size:small;font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">and </span><span style=\"font-size:small\">re_v </span><span style=\"white-space:pre;word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-size:small;font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> equal to </span><span style=\"font-family:MJXc-TeX-main-R,MJXc-TeX-main-Rw;white-space:pre;word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-size:small\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:MJXc-TeX-main-R,MJXc-TeX-main-Rw;white-space:pre;word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-size:small\">,...</span><span style=\"font-family:MJXc-TeX-math-I,MJXc-TeX-math-Ix,MJXc-TeX-math-Iw;word-spacing:normal;white-space:pre;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-size:small\">n </span><span style=\"word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:small\">is the number of counties. </span><span style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">This can be obtained with the number of rows in the data (</span><span style=\"font-size:small;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem\">nrow(map)</span><span style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">).</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">map$re_u  &lt;- 1:nrow(map)<br>map$re_v  &lt;- 1:nrow(map)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">The response variable is </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem\">Y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">. Random effects are defined using </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/pkg/INLA/man/f.html\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-color:rgb(204,204,204);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/pkg/INLA/man/f.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792434548468000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29MJ78eDkdc8JaaKG6ztWc\">f()</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> with parameters equal to the name of the index variable and the chosen model. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> We use </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem\">model = &quot;besag&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> with neighborhood matrix given by </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem\">g</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">. We also use option </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem\">scale.model = TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"> to make the precision parameter of models with different CAR priors comparable </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">(<a href=\"https://www.paulamoraga.com/book-geospatial/references.html#ref-FreniSterrantinoetal18\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,104,217);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.paulamoraga.com/book-geospatial/references.html%23ref-FreniSterrantinoetal18&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792434548468000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zGp-MykYZPV549QX34dcT\">Freni-Sterrantino, Ventrucci, and Rue 2018</a>)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">. Then</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">, we choose </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(33,37,41);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem\">model = &quot;iid&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">.</span></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">formula &lt;- CrudeR ~ f(re_u, model = &quot;besag&quot;, graph = g, scale.model = TRUE) + f(re_v, model = &quot;iid&quot;)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:1rem;color:rgb(33,37,41);font-family:-apple-system,&quot;system-ui&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">We fit the model by calling the <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem;white-space:inherit\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/pkg/INLA/man/inla.html\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-color:rgb(204,204,204);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/pkg/INLA/man/inla.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792434548468000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ynY-6roe3__k77I8oOL0y\">inla()</a></span> function. We specify the formula, family (<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem;white-space:inherit\">&quot;</span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">lognormal</span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem;white-space:inherit\">&quot;</span>), data. We also set <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem;white-space:inherit\">control.predictor</span> equal to <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0.2rem;padding:0.125rem 0.25rem;white-space:inherit\">list(compute = TRUE)</span> to compute the posteriors of the predictions.</font></p><font size=\"2\">res &lt;- inla(formula, family = &quot;lognormal&quot;, data = map,</font><br><font size=\"2\">              control.predictor = list(compute = TRUE),</font><br><font size=\"2\">              control.compute = list(dic = TRUE))</font></div>"
    ]
   ]
